WEBVTT

00:17:29.708 --> 00:17:33.059
She was a pushover
who was all about relationships,

00:17:33.083 --> 00:17:36.101
but I was thrilled to see them
land in the same place.

00:17:36.125 --> 00:17:38.309
They both learned
that building relationships

00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:40.184
is a way of getting results,

00:17:40.208 --> 00:17:44.643
that before you claim value,
you need to create value,

00:17:44.667 --> 00:17:49.143
but many times we don't know
what the person across the table values.

00:17:49.167 --> 00:17:51.268
To figure that out,
we're gonna dive into one

00:17:51.292 --> 00:17:54.059
of the most important
negotiations in modern history

00:17:54.083 --> 00:17:55.333
right after the break.

00:17:58.708 --> 00:18:01.226
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.